        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三角函数练习题</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f4f2ee;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 24px 30px 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #f4f2ee;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .q {\n    margin: 12px 0 4px 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .q .paren {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .options {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px 18px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .options > div {\n    width: 25%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 26px 0 14px 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 14px;\n  }\n  .cont {\n    margin-left: 14px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"q\">\n    14. 已知角 $\\theta$ 的始边为 $x$ 轴非负半轴，终边经过点 $P(1,2)$ 则 $\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"q\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n    的值为 <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $-\\dfrac{1}{3}$</div>\n    <div>B. $\\dfrac{1}{3}$</div>\n    <div>C. $-\\dfrac{2}{3}$</div>\n    <div>D. $\\dfrac{2}{3}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q\">\n    15. 设 $\\tan\\alpha=3$，则 $\\dfrac{\\sin(\\alpha-\\pi)+\\cos(\\pi-\\alpha)}{\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-\\alpha\\right)+\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha\\right)}=$\n    <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $\\dfrac{10}{3}$</div>\n    <div>B. $\\dfrac{5}{3}$</div>\n    <div>C. 3</div>\n    <div>D. 2</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">拔高题组</div>\n\n  <div class=\"q indent\">\n    1. $\\tan 105^\\circ=$ <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $2-\\sqrt{3}$</div>\n    <div>B. $-2-\\sqrt{3}$</div>\n    <div>C. $\\sqrt{3}-2$</div>\n    <div>D. $-\\sqrt{3}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q indent\">\n    2. $\\cos 15^\\circ\\cos 75^\\circ=$ <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$</div>\n    <div>B. $\\dfrac{1}{2}$</div>\n    <div>C. $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}$</div>\n    <div>D. $\\dfrac{1}{4}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q indent\">\n    3. 已知 $\\sin\\alpha+\\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac{1}{5}$，则 $\\sin 2\\alpha$ 的值是 <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $-\\dfrac{24}{25}$</div>\n    <div>B. $-\\dfrac{7}{25}$</div>\n    <div>C. $\\dfrac{7}{25}$</div>\n    <div>D. $\\dfrac{24}{25}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q indent\">\n    4. 已知 $\\sin\\alpha-\\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac{4}{3}$，则 $\\sin 2\\alpha=$ <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $-\\dfrac{7}{16}$</div>\n    <div>B. $-\\dfrac{7}{9}$</div>\n    <div>C. $\\dfrac{7}{16}$</div>\n    <div>D. $\\dfrac{7}{9}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q indent\">\n    5. 已知角 $\\alpha$ 的顶点与原点重合，始边与 $x$ 轴的非负半轴重合，点\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"q cont\" style=\"margin-top:0; margin-left:28px;\">\n    $P(-1,3)$ 在角 $\\alpha$ 的终边上，则 $\\dfrac{\\sin\\alpha-\\cos\\alpha}{2\\sin\\alpha-3\\cos\\alpha}=$\n    <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $-\\dfrac{3}{4}$</div>\n    <div>B. $\\dfrac{3}{4}$</div>\n    <div>C. $-\\dfrac{4}{9}$</div>\n    <div>D. $\\dfrac{4}{9}$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q indent\">\n    6. 已知角 $\\alpha$ 的终边过点 $P(1,2)$ 则 $\\dfrac{2\\sin\\alpha+\\cos\\alpha}{2\\sin\\alpha-\\cos\\alpha}=$\n    <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. 2</div>\n    <div>B. 1</div>\n    <div>C. $-1$</div>\n    <div>D. $-2$</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"q indent\">\n    7. 已知 $\\sin\\alpha-3\\cos\\alpha=0$，则 $\\dfrac{3\\cos\\alpha-4\\sin\\alpha}{\\sin\\alpha+\\cos\\alpha}=$\n    <span class=\"paren\">（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"options\">\n    <div>A. $-\\dfrac{9}{4}$</div>\n    <div>B. $\\dfrac{4}{9}$</div>\n    <div>C. $\\dfrac{3}{4}$</div>\n    <div>D. $-3$</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
